    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Gurgle — one of Avarice's two loyal gargoyle bodyguards/scouts (Gargle and Gurgle). Away spying on her wizardly rivals when the party arrives. Avarice calls them back telepathically (Rary's telepathic bond) when confronted.</p><p><strong>DM:</strong> If the party slays or captures Avarice, both gargoyles attack as the party leaves the keep. Under a Dark Alliance they take shifts atop the southwest guard tower, watching the party.</p>",
